r#  40495  741  40


--- Sentence//end
id: 229
r#  40652  743  55
p: .
t. 
|   Sometimes unseen posits are
|  deemed just as real as everything else, merely beyond our capabilities
.  of (instrument-enhanced) observation, at least for now


