p: .
t. 
|  A good example of formal answers to the second question is
|  <!!Bolt et. al.!!> [/Bolt/], based on Peter <!!Gardenfors!!>'s Conceptual Space
|  theory, alongside a syntactic approach related to Categorial Grammar
.  and mathematical Category Theory


