|  does not assert a presumed fact but rather obtains a computed
.  result, perhaps then used in some larger or future expression


--- Sentence/switch
id: 485
r#  87908  1650  63


--- Sentence//end
id: 485
r#  88220  1655  19
p: .
t. 
|  However, there are various commonalities between sets of interrelated
|  software procedures (e.g., code libraries, coalescing <!!"!!>procedural<!!"!!>
|  rather than <!!"!!>declarative<!!"!!> knowledge [/AnirudhGoyal/]) and graph databases,
|  that could potentially serve as approximative inspiration for theories
.  of human cognition


--- Sentence/switch
id: 486
r#  88221  1655  20


--- Sentence//end
id: 486
r#  88349  1657  17
p: .
t. 
|   Procedural <!!"!!>memoization<!!"!!> (caching results to
|  avoid repeating prior calculations) combines evaluation and
.  data-persistence


