--- Sentence//end
id: 514
r#  93398  1753  39
p: .
t. 
|  This formulation generalizes the typically <!!"!!>local<!!"!!> phenomenon
|  of one concept modifying another, to a more holistic
|  realm where syntheses are molded against enactive
.  and situational (agent/role) templates


--- Sentence/switch
