r#  93399  1753  40


--- Sentence//end
id: 515
r#  93565  1755  55
p: .
t. 
|   Meanwhile, the expansion of conceptual
|  synthesis into a multi-themed complex expands the plurality of sites
.  where speakers express epistemically-inflected content


